PATCH GENERATION NOTE
=====================
The repository has no initial commit, so Git has no historical blob against
which to express the manuscript edit.  Intent-to-add metadata was used only to
make the untracked file visible to git diff; no file contents were staged.
Consequently stage00_review.diff records the complete corrected
manuscript/manuscript.tex as a new-file patch.  The diff is path-limited to the
only source file changed by this audit.  stage00_review.diff and
stage00_review.log are therefore not included in the patch.

SMALLEST LOGICALLY COHERENT NEXT STEP
=====================================
Assume F != 0, introduce a coefficient-ratio recurrence (with a scaling chosen
to expose the factorial Bargmann weight), determine its two large-n asymptotic
branches, and prove which branch is weighted-square-summable.  Only after that
minimal-solution statement is established should the n=0 boundary condition be
matched to it and a continued-fraction characteristic function be defined.
